[[File:Winterhoof Waterwell.jpg|thumb|The Winterhoof Water Well.]]

The '''Winterhoof Water Well''' is located at the edge of the [[Rolling Plains]] in southern [[Mulgore]].{{co|53|66|Mulgore}}

Years after the [[Third War]], the well was taken and poisoned over by the [[Venture Company]] in order to control the water supply, but they were eventually run off by the [[tauren]] [[adventurer]]s, while [[Mull Thunderhorn]] created a totem to cleanse the waters.

