'''Worn Letter''' can be found in a [[Forlorn Crate]] in [[Moonwhisper Coast]].

==As a quest objective==
* {{questlong|Horde|57|Seeking the Truth}}

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Moondancer.

Were you always this much of an imbecile? I have waited for hours. Last we spoke I told you how important our time is and yet you fail me in my hours of most need. You used to be such a dependable apprentice. No matter. I trust you have not somehow managed to get yourself killed by the naga of Nendis and will find this letter once you arrive.

I have the artifact, I leave its coffer behind for you to find. After all, I need you to come find me. Zandaxxius was right, this artefact holds a great power. I am heading towards the Temple of Elunaris, I am certain Lo’sho will answer my prayers and fuel me with the required strength to wield this power. I can finally have my vengeance on Moonhoof and his righteous patron. I wonder how we will react when he witnesses it all. Join me swiftly, Moondancer. We have work to do.
}}

